<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>어데가노 🗺 부산 여행의 모든 것</title>
  <meta name="description" content="부산 관광 데이터 기반 여행 추천 웹앱. 맞춤 코스 추천, 부산 방언 스토리텔링, 실시간 날씨·축제 정보 제공." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" />
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"></script>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    :root {
      --primary: #0ea5e9;
      --primary-dark: #0071e3;
      --dark: #1d1d1f;
      --text: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
      --muted: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.48);
      --light-muted: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);
      --bg: #f5f5f7;
      --bg-alt: #ffffff;
      --border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      --white: #ffffff;
      --shadow-sm: none;
      --shadow-md: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22) 3px 5px 30px 0px;
      --shadow-lg: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22) 3px 5px 30px 0px;
      --radius-card: 12px;
      --radius-chip: 980px;
      --radius-btn: 8px;
      --apple-blue: #0071e3;
      --link-blue: #0066cc;
      --link-blue-dark: #2997ff;
      --dark-surface: #272729;
      --onb-primary: #0071e3;
      --onb-primary-light: #42a5f5;
      --onb-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #0071e3 0%, #42a5f5 50%, #81d4fa 100%);
      --onb-card-bg: #ffffff;
      --onb-card-radius: 20px;
      --onb-card-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 50, 120, 0.08);
      --onb-chip-bg: #f5f9ff;
      --onb-chip-bg-active: #0071e3;
      --onb-chip-text: #0071e3;
      --onb-chip-text-active: #ffffff;
      --onb-step-dot: #e0e7ff;
      --onb-step-dot-active: #0071e3;
      --onb-title-size: 28px;
      --onb-subtitle-size: 15px;
      --onb-font-weight-bold: 700;
    }
    html, body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Text', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Pretendard Variable', Pretendard, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      letter-spacing: -0.374px;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    button { font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; border: none; background: none; }
    input { font-family: inherit; }
    img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .hide-scroll { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }

    /* === Layout === */
    .container { max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }

    /* === Header === */
    .main-header {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1000;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
      backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
      height: 48px;
    }
    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px;
      height: 100%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px;
    }
    .logo { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; flex-shrink: 0; cursor: pointer; }
    .logo-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .logo-sub { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-weight: 400; }
    .search-bar {
      flex: 1; max-width: 380px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: #fafafc;
      border: 3px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      height: 38px;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .search-bar:focus-within { background: #ffffff; }
    .search-bar input {
      flex: 1; border: none; background: transparent; outline: none;
      font-size: 14px; color: var(--dark);
    }
    .search-bar input::placeholder { color: var(--light-muted); }
    .search-bar button { font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); }
    .header-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .header-right a { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); font-weight: 400; }
    .header-right a:hover { color: #ffffff; }
    .btn-primary {
      background: #0071e3; color: white;
      padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 17px; font-weight: 400;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }

    /* === Nav Tabs === */
    .nav-tabs {
      position: sticky; top: 48px; z-index: 999;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
      backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
      height: 48px;
    }
    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px;
      height: 100%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .nav-tab {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      padding: 0 16px;
      height: 100%;
      display: flex; align-items: center;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      border-bottom: 2.5px solid transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
    }
    .nav-tab:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); }
    .nav-tab.active { color: #ffffff; border-bottom-color: #ffffff; }

    /* === Hero Carousel === */
    .hero {
      margin: 20px auto 16px;
      max-width: 1060px;
      padding: 0 16px;
    }
    .hero-carousel {
      position: relative;
      height: 360px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero-slide {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.8s ease;
      background-size: cover; background-position: center;
      display: flex; align-items: flex-end;
      padding: 40px;
    }
    .hero-slide.active { opacity: 1; z-index: 2; }
    .hero-slide::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.7) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%);
    }
    .hero-slide-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; color: white; max-width: 600px; }
    .hero-slide-content h1 { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.07; margin-bottom: 8px; text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .hero-slide-content p { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.95; text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
    .hero-dots {
      position: absolute; bottom: 20px; left: 40px; z-index: 3;
      display: flex; gap: 6px;
    }
    .hero-dot {
      width: 24px; height: 4px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
      border-radius: 2px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .hero-dot.active { background: white; }
    .hero-counter {
      position: absolute; bottom: 20px; right: 24px; z-index: 3;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); color: white;
      padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* === Mood Chips === */
    .mood-chips {
      display: flex; gap: 8px;
      padding: 4px 0 4px;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .mood-chip {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      background: #fafafc;
      color: var(--text);
      border: 3px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
      border-radius: 980px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
      transition: all 0.15s;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .mood-chip:hover { background: #f0f0f2; }
    .mood-chip.active { background: #0071e3; color: white; border-color: #0071e3; }

    /* === Section === */
    section.content-section { padding: 24px 0; }
    .section-head {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .section-head h2 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); letter-spacing: -0.28px; line-height: 1.1; }
    .section-head a, .section-head button.see-more-btn { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
    .section-head a:hover, .section-head button.see-more-btn:hover { color: var(--primary); }
    .section-copy {
      margin-top: -8px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* === Quick Start === */
    .quick-start {
      margin: 8px 0 8px;
      padding: 28px 32px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #000000;
      color: white;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .quick-start::before {
      content: 'BUSAN';
      position: absolute;
      right: 22px;
      top: 18px;
      font-size: 54px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      opacity: 0.08;
    }
    .quick-start-kicker {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1.4px;
      opacity: 0.78;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .quick-start-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .quick-start-title {
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.07;
      letter-spacing: -0.7px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .quick-start-desc {
      max-width: 620px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      opacity: 0.92;
    }
    .quick-start-chip {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      align-self: flex-start;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 980px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .quick-start-grid {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .quick-start-card {
      min-height: 188px;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #272729;
      border: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .quick-start-card.featured {
      background: #272729;
    }
    .quick-start-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    .quick-start-card h3 {
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }
    .quick-start-card p {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .quick-start-card button {
      align-self: flex-start;
    }
    .quick-start-btn {
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: 980px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.94);
      color: var(--dark);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s, background 0.15s;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    }
    .quick-start-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      background: white;
    }
    .quick-start-btn.secondary {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
      color: white;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
      box-shadow: none;
    }
    .quick-start-btn.secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.22);
    }

    /* === Roulette Button === */
    .roulette-btn {
      background: white;
      color: #0f4c81;
      padding: 13px 28px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      transition: transform 0.15s;
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }
    .roulette-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .roulette-btn:active { transform: translateY(0); }
    .roulette-btn.spinning { pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.88; }
    .roulette-btn .icon { display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; }
    .roulette-btn.spinning .icon { animation: spinRoll 0.5s linear infinite; }
    @keyframes spinRoll { from { transform: rotate(0); } to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

    /* === Theme Tiles === */
    .theme-tiles {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(9, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .theme-tile {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 8px 4px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
    }
    .theme-tile:hover { background: var(--bg-alt); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .theme-tile-icon {
      width: 64px; height: 64px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #f5f5f7;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }
    .theme-tile-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); text-align: center; }
    
    .theme-tile[data-theme="바다힐링"] .theme-tile-icon { background-image: url('./assets/images/busan_theme_sea.png'); }
    .theme-tile[data-theme="뉴트로감성"] .theme-tile-icon { background-image: url('./assets/images/busan_theme_retro.png'); }
    .theme-tile[data-theme="야경투어"] .theme-tile-icon { background-image: url('./assets/images/busan_theme_night.png'); }
    .theme-tile[data-theme="미식여행"] .theme-tile-icon { background-image: url('./assets/images/busan_theme_food.png'); }
    .theme-tile[data-theme="산책길"] .theme-tile-icon { background-image: url('./assets/images/busan_theme_walk.png'); }
    .theme-tile[data-theme="사진맛집"] .theme-tile-icon { background-image: url('./assets/images/busan_theme_photo.png'); }
    .theme-tile[data-theme="가족나들이"] .theme-tile-icon { background-image: url('./assets/images/busan_theme_family.png'); }
    .theme-tile[data-theme="커플데이트"] .theme-tile-icon { background-image: url('./assets/images/busan_theme_couple.png'); }
    .theme-tile[data-theme="혼행"] .theme-tile-icon { background-image: url('./assets/images/busan_theme_solo.png'); }

    /* === Card Carousel === */
    .card-carousel {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    }
    .card-carousel > * { scroll-snap-align: start; }


    /* === Carousel Wrap & Navigation === */
    .carousel-wrap {
      position: relative;
    }
    .carousel-arrow {
      position: absolute; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      color: var(--dark);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer; z-index: 10;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
      transition: all 0.2s;
      opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
    }
    /* Show arrows on hover of the wrapper (only on non-touch screens usually, but we'll manage via JS/opacity) */
    .carousel-wrap:hover .carousel-arrow.visible { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
    .carousel-arrow:hover { background: var(--white); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.05); }
    .carousel-arrow.prev { left: -22px; }
    .carousel-arrow.next { right: -22px; }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .carousel-arrow { display: none; } /* Hide arrows on mobile where swipe is natural */
    }

    /* === Travel Card === */
    .travel-card {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 260px;
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      overflow: hidden;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), box-shadow 0.25s;
      position: relative;
    }
    .travel-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.02); box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22) 3px 5px 30px 0px; }
    .travel-card .card-image-wrap {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 4/3;
      background: var(--bg-alt);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .travel-card .card-image {
      width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }
    .travel-card:hover .card-image { transform: scale(1.05); }
    .travel-card .rank-badge {
      position: absolute; top: 12px; left: 12px;
      width: 32px; height: 32px;
      background: rgba(16,20,24,0.85); color: white;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .travel-card .type-badge {
      position: absolute; top: 12px; right: 12px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      color: var(--dark);
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .travel-card .card-body {
      padding: 14px 16px 16px;
    }
    .travel-card .card-title {
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark);
      line-height: 1.35;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 1;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .travel-card .card-addr {
      font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted);
      overflow: hidden;
      white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .travel-card .card-dialect {
      font-size: 12px; color: var(--primary);
      font-style: italic;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 1;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    }

    /* === Skeleton === */
    .skeleton-card {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 260px;
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .skeleton-card .skel-img { aspect-ratio: 4/3; background: var(--bg-alt); }
    .skeleton-card .skel-body { padding: 14px 16px; }
    .skeleton-card .skel-line { height: 12px; background: var(--bg-alt); border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .skeleton-card .skel-line.sm { width: 60%; }
    .skel-img, .skel-line { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .skel-img::after, .skel-line::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.55), transparent);
      animation: shimmer 1.4s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes shimmer { 0% { transform: translateX(-100%); } 100% { transform: translateX(100%); } }

    .empty-card {
      flex-shrink: 0; width: 100%;
      padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center;
      background: var(--white); border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* === Live Dashboard Band === */
    .live-band {
      margin: 8px 0 16px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #000000;
      color: white;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .live-band .lb-title {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; opacity: 0.85;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .live-tile {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .live-tile .icon { font-size: 26px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .live-tile .body { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
    .live-tile .label { font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.8; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
    .live-tile .value { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
    .live-tile .sub { font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.85; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }

    /* === Chatbot FAB === */
    .chatbot-fab {
      position: fixed; right: 24px; bottom: 24px; z-index: 500;
      width: 60px; height: 60px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #0071e3;
      color: white;
      font-size: 26px;
      box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22) 3px 5px 30px 0px;
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }
    .chatbot-fab:hover { transform: scale(1.08); }
    .chatbot-fab.hidden { display: none; }
    .chatbot-fab-badge {
      position: absolute; top: -4px; right: -4px;
      background: #ef4444; color: white;
      font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600;
      padding: 3px 7px; border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }

    /* === Chatbot Panel === */
    .chatbot-panel {
      position: fixed; right: 24px; bottom: 24px; z-index: 600;
      width: 400px; height: 560px; max-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px) scale(0.96);
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: all 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .chatbot-panel.open { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); pointer-events: auto; }
    .chatbot-header {
      background: #0071e3;
      color: white;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .chatbot-header-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; }
    .chatbot-header-title small { display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 2px; }
    .chatbot-close {
      width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color: white;
      font-size: 18px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }
    .chatbot-close:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.32); }
    .chatbot-messages {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 16px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      background: var(--bg);
    }
    .msg {
      max-width: 80%;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      word-wrap: break-word;
    }
    .msg.bot {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--dark);
      border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .msg.user {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
      margin-left: auto;
    }
    .msg .course-item {
      margin-top: 6px;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      background: var(--bg-alt);
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .chatbot-suggestions {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;
      padding: 0 16px 8px;
      background: var(--bg);
    }
    .suggestion {
      padding: 7px 12px;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--primary);
      border: 1px solid var(--primary);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
    }
    .suggestion:hover { background: var(--primary); color: white; }
    .chatbot-input-area {
      display: flex; gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--white);
    }
    .chatbot-input {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 13px;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.15s;
    }
    .chatbot-input:focus { border-color: var(--primary); }
    .chatbot-send {
      padding: 10px 18px;
      background: var(--primary); color: white;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;
    }
    .chatbot-send:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }

    /* === Course Modal === */
    .modal-backdrop {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 700;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      display: none;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .modal-backdrop.open { display: flex; }
    .modal {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 16px;
      max-width: 720px; width: 100%;
      max-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }
    .modal-head {
      padding: 18px 24px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .modal-head h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); }
    .modal-head .modal-close {
      width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--bg-alt); color: var(--dark);
      font-size: 18px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }
    .modal-head .modal-close:hover { background: #e9ecef; }
    .modal-body {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .modal-map {
      width: 100%; height: 300px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bg-alt);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .course-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
    .course-item-card {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: border-color 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
    }
    .course-item-card:hover { border-color: var(--primary); transform: translateX(2px); }
    .course-item-card .pin-badge {
      width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: white; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .course-item-card .info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .course-item-card .info .name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .course-item-card .info .addr { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
    .course-item-card .info .dialect { font-size: 11px; color: var(--primary); font-style: italic; margin-top: 3px; }
    .course-item-card .thumb {
      width: 70px; height: 70px; border-radius: 8px; flex-shrink: 0;
      background: var(--bg-alt); object-fit: cover;
    }
    .modal-foot {
      padding: 14px 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: flex-end;
    }
    .modal-foot button {
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-btn);
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;
    }
    .modal-foot .btn-ghost { background: var(--bg-alt); color: var(--dark); }
    .modal-foot .btn-ghost:hover { background: #e9ecef; }
    .modal-foot .btn-share { background: var(--primary); color: white; }
    .modal-foot .btn-share:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }

    /* ============================================ */
    /* === DETAIL PAGE (Full overlay) === */
    /* ============================================ */
    .detail-overlay {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1100;
      background: #f5f5f7;
      overflow-y: auto;
      transform: translateY(100%);
      transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
    }
    .detail-overlay.open {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    .detail-header {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 2000;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      height: 60px; padding: 0 20px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
      backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
    }
    .detail-header-left, .detail-header-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .detail-header-title {
      font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; flex: 1; text-align: center;
      white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; padding: 0 16px;
      color: #ffffff;
      opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s;
    }
    .detail-header-title.visible { opacity: 1; }
    .detail-icon-btn {
      width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 22px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.15s;
      background: none; border: none; color: #ffffff;
    }
    .detail-icon-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }

    /* === Detail Tab Bar === */
    .detail-tabbar {
      position: sticky; top: 60px; z-index: 1999;
      background: var(--white);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex; align-items: center;
      height: 44px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .detail-tabbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .detail-tab {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      padding: 0 20px;
      height: 100%;
      display: flex; align-items: center;
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted);
      border-bottom: 2.5px solid transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .detail-tab:hover { color: var(--text); }
    .detail-tab.active { color: var(--dark); border-bottom-color: var(--primary); }

    /* === Detail Gallery Counter === */
    .detail-gallery-counter {
      position: absolute; bottom: 16px; right: 16px; z-index: 5;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.55); color: white;
      padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    }

    /* === Detail Section Card Style === */
    .detail-section-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .detail-section-card h3 {
      font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    }

    .detail-hero {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%; height: 420px;
      background: var(--bg-alt);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .detail-hero img {
      width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
    }
    .detail-hero-gradient {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.75) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 60%, transparent 100%);
    }
    .detail-hero-content {
      position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      padding: 32px 40px;
      color: white;
    }
    .detail-hero-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .detail-hero-content h1 {
      font-size: 32px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.07;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .detail-hero-content .subtitle {
      font-size: 15px; opacity: 0.9; font-weight: 500;
    }
.detail-share-btn {
      position: absolute; top: 20px; right: 20px; z-index: 5;
      width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.45); color: white;
      font-size: 18px; backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .detail-share-btn:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.65); }

    .detail-body {
      max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 24px 80px;
    }

    /* Info Cards Row */
    .detail-info-cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .detail-info-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      padding: 16px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .detail-info-card .dic-icon { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .detail-info-card .dic-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .detail-info-card .dic-value { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark); }

    /* Dialect Story */
    .detail-dialect-box {
      background: #f5f5f7;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 24px 28px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .detail-dialect-box::before {
      content: '💬'; position: absolute; right: 12px; top: 8px;
      font-size: 60px; opacity: 0.12;
    }
    .detail-dialect-box .dialect-label {
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .detail-dialect-box .dialect-text {
      font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark);
      font-style: italic;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Detail Map */
    .detail-map-section {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .detail-map-section h3 {
      font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .detail-map-wrap {
      width: 100%; height: 280px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .detail-addr-row {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-btn);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .detail-addr-row .addr-icon { font-size: 16px; }
    .detail-addr-row .addr-text { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); flex: 1; }
    .detail-addr-row .addr-copy {
      font-size: 12px; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .detail-addr-row .addr-copy:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    /* Nearby Section */
    .detail-nearby {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .detail-nearby h3 {
      font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    /* === Detail Gallery === */
    .detail-gallery { margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .detail-gallery h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .detail-gallery-scroll {
      display: flex; gap: 10px; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 8px;
      -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .detail-gallery-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .detail-gallery-scroll img {
      width: 200px; height: 140px; object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 10px; flex-shrink: 0; cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }
    .detail-gallery-scroll img:hover { transform: scale(1.03); }

    /* === Detail Intro Section (Card Grid) === */
    .detail-intro-section { margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .detail-intro-section h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .detail-intro-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .detail-intro-row {
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
    }
    .detail-intro-row:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .detail-intro-icon {
      font-size: 28px; width: 44px; height: 44px; flex-shrink: 0;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      background: var(--bg-alt); border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .detail-intro-label {
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }
    .detail-intro-value {
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .detail-intro-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }

    /* === Detail Menu Section (restaurants) === */
    .detail-menu-section { margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .detail-menu-section h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .detail-menu-list {
      background: var(--white); border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); overflow: hidden;
    }
    .detail-menu-item {
      display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 14px 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); gap: 12px;
    }
    .detail-menu-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .detail-menu-img {
      width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 8px;
      object-fit: cover; flex-shrink: 0; background: var(--bg-alt);
    }
    .detail-menu-info { flex: 1; }
    .detail-menu-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark); }
    .detail-menu-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
    .detail-menu-price {
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary); white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* === Detail Room Section (accommodation) === */
    .detail-room-section { margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .detail-room-section h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .detail-room-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .detail-room-card {
      background: var(--white); border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); overflow: hidden;
      display: flex; gap: 16px; padding: 16px;
    }
    .detail-room-card img {
      width: 120px; height: 90px; border-radius: 8px;
      object-fit: cover; flex-shrink: 0; background: var(--bg-alt);
    }
    .detail-room-info { flex: 1; }
    .detail-room-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .detail-room-meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .detail-room-price { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary); }

    /* === Detail Section Common === */
    .detail-section-box {
      background: var(--white); border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      padding: 20px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .detail-section-box h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 12px; }

    /* ============================================ */
    /* === THEME / CATEGORY PAGE === */
    /* ============================================ */
    .category-overlay {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1050;
      background: #f5f5f7;
      overflow-y: auto;
      transform: translateX(100%);
      transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
    }
    .category-overlay.open {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
    .category-header {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 5;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
      backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
      height: 48px;
    }
    .category-header-inner {
      max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px;
      height: 100%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
    }
    .category-back {
      width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 18px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .category-back:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }
    .category-header-logo {
      display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .category-header-logo .cat-logo-icon { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; }
    .category-header-logo .cat-logo-divider { width: 1px; height: 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); margin: 0 4px; align-self: center; }
    .category-header-title {
      font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .category-search {
      flex: 1; max-width: 320px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: #fafafc;
      border: 3px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      height: 38px;
    }
    .category-search input {
      flex: 1; border: none; background: transparent; outline: none;
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--dark);
    }
    .category-search input::placeholder { color: var(--light-muted); }
    .category-search button { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
    .category-header-count {
      font-size: 12px; color: var(--white); font-weight: 700;
      background: var(--primary);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-left: auto;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .category-body {
      max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px 16px 80px;
    }
    .category-filter-row {
      display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .cat-filter-chip {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .cat-filter-chip:hover { border-color: var(--primary); color: var(--primary); }
    .cat-filter-chip.active {
      background: var(--dark); color: white; border-color: var(--dark);
    }

    /* Category Grid */
    .category-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .category-grid .travel-card {
      width: 100%;
      flex-shrink: initial;
    }

    /* Category skeleton grid */
    .category-grid .skeleton-card {
      width: 100%;
      flex-shrink: initial;
    }


    /* === Footer === */
    .main-footer {
      margin-top: 60px;
      background: var(--dark);
      color: #adb5bd;
      padding: 40px 0 32px;
    }
    .footer-inner { text-align: center; }
    .footer-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: white; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .footer-desc { font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .footer-credit { font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.7; }
    .footer-social { display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; }
    .footer-social span { cursor: pointer; opacity: 0.7; transition: opacity 0.15s; }
    .footer-social span:hover { opacity: 1; }

    /* === Toast === */
    .toast {
      position: fixed; bottom: 32px; left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, 20px);
      background: var(--dark); color: white;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
      transition: all 0.25s;
      z-index: 900;
    }
    .toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); }

    /* ============================================ */
    /* === ACCOMMODATION SEARCH & DETAIL (Phase 2) === */
    /* ============================================ */
    .accommodation-page {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1080;
      background: var(--bg);
      overflow-y: auto;
      transform: translateX(100%);
      transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
    }
    .accommodation-page.open {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
    .acc-page-header {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 2000;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.97);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0 16px;
      height: 56px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
    }
    .acc-back-btn {
      width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer; background: none; border: none;
      color: var(--dark); transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .acc-back-btn:hover { background: var(--bg-alt); }
    .acc-page-title {
      font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark);
      flex: 1; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    /* Search bar area */
    .accommodation-search-bar {
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .acc-search-input-wrap {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: var(--bg-alt);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      height: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .acc-search-input-wrap input {
      flex: 1; border: none; background: transparent; outline: none;
      font-size: 14px; color: var(--dark);
    }
    .acc-search-input-wrap input::placeholder { color: var(--light-muted); }
    .acc-search-input-wrap button { font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
    .acc-date-people-bar {
      display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center;
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .acc-date-people-bar span {
      background: var(--bg-alt);
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .filter-chips {
      display: flex; gap: 8px; overflow-x: auto;
      -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .filter-chips::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .filter-chip {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-chip);
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .filter-chip:hover { border-color: var(--primary); color: var(--primary); }
    .filter-chip.active { background: var(--dark); color: white; border-color: var(--dark); }

    /* 2-column grid */
    .accommodation-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      max-width: 1060px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .acc-grid-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .acc-grid-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .acc-grid-card .acc-card-img {
      width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/3;
      object-fit: cover; background: var(--bg-alt);
      display: block;
    }
    .acc-grid-card .acc-card-body { padding: 12px 14px 14px; }
    .acc-card-cat {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .acc-card-name {
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 1; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    }
    .acc-card-loc {
      font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .acc-card-rating {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
      font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .acc-card-rating .stars { color: #ffa500; }
    .acc-card-rating .review-cnt { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
    .acc-card-price {
      font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary);
    }
    .acc-card-price small { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); }

    /* Accommodation Detail Page */
    .accommodation-detail {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1090;
      background: var(--bg);
      overflow-y: auto;
      transform: translateX(100%);
      transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
    }
    .accommodation-detail.open {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
    .acc-detail-gallery {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%; height: 360px;
      background: var(--bg-alt);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .acc-detail-gallery img.main-img {
      width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
    }
    .acc-detail-gallery .gallery-counter {
      position: absolute; bottom: 16px; right: 16px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.55); color: white;
      padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .acc-detail-thumbs {
      display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 16px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .acc-detail-thumbs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .acc-detail-thumbs img {
      width: 72px; height: 54px; object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: border-color 0.15s;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .acc-detail-thumbs img.active { border-color: var(--primary); }
    .acc-detail-thumbs img:hover { border-color: var(--primary); }

    .acc-detail-body {
      max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px 16px 100px;
    }
    .acc-detail-info {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .acc-detail-cat-grade {
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .acc-detail-name {
      font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .acc-detail-rating {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .acc-detail-rating .stars { color: #ffa500; }
    .acc-detail-rating .score { font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark); }
    .acc-detail-rating .cnt { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .acc-detail-location {
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted);
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
    }

    .acc-detail-checkin-out {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .acc-checkin-block, .acc-checkout-block { text-align: center; }
    .acc-checkin-block .label, .acc-checkout-block .label {
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .acc-checkin-block .time, .acc-checkout-block .time {
      font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark);
    }

    .acc-detail-amenities {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .acc-detail-amenities h3 {
      font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .amenity-list {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;
    }
    .amenity-item {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      background: var(--bg-alt);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text);
    }
    .amenity-icon { font-size: 18px; }

    .acc-detail-desc {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .acc-detail-desc h3 {
      font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .acc-detail-desc p {
      font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text);
    }

    /* Booking bar */
    .acc-booking-bar {
      position: fixed; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      z-index: 2100;
      background: var(--white);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 12px 16px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      box-shadow: 0 -4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }
    .acc-booking-bar .booking-price {
      font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark);
    }
    .acc-booking-bar .booking-price small {
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted);
    }
    .acc-booking-bar .booking-btn {
      background: var(--primary); color: white;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-btn);
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
      border: none; cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .acc-booking-bar .booking-btn:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }

    /* === Responsive === */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .header-inner { gap: 12px; padding: 0 14px; }
      .logo-sub { display: none; }
      .logo-title { font-size: 19px; }
      .search-bar { height: 38px; padding: 0 14px; }
      .search-bar input { font-size: 13px; }
      .header-right a { display: none; }
      .btn-primary { padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 13px; }

      .nav-inner { gap: 0; padding: 0 14px; }
      .nav-tab { padding: 0 12px; font-size: 12px; }

      .hero { padding: 0 14px; margin-top: 16px; }
      .hero-carousel { height: 240px; }
      .hero-slide { padding: 24px; }
      .hero-slide-content h1 { font-size: 22px; }
      .hero-slide-content p { font-size: 13px; }
      .hero-dots { left: 24px; bottom: 16px; }
      .hero-counter { right: 16px; bottom: 16px; font-size: 11px; }

      .container { padding: 0 14px; }
      section.content-section { padding: 18px 0; }
      .section-head h2 { font-size: 18px; }

      .quick-start {
        padding: 24px 20px;
      }
      .quick-start-head {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .quick-start-title { font-size: 24px; }
      .quick-start-desc { font-size: 13px; }
      .quick-start-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .quick-start-card { min-height: 0; }
      .roulette-btn { padding: 11px 22px; font-size: 13px; }

      .theme-tiles { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
      .theme-tile-icon { width: 56px; height: 56px; font-size: 24px; }

      .travel-card, .skeleton-card { width: 200px; }
      .travel-card .card-title { font-size: 14px; }

      .live-band { padding: 16px 18px; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .live-tile .value { font-size: 14px; }

      .chatbot-fab { right: 16px; bottom: 16px; width: 54px; height: 54px; font-size: 24px; }
      .chatbot-panel {
        right: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0;
        width: 100%; height: 85vh; max-height: 85vh;
        border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
      }

      .modal-backdrop { padding: 0; align-items: flex-end; }
      .modal { border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0; max-height: 92vh; }
      .modal-head { padding: 14px 18px; }
      .modal-body { padding: 16px 18px; }
      .modal-map { height: 220px; }
      .modal-foot { padding: 12px 18px; }

      /* Detail */
      .detail-hero { height: 300px; }
      .detail-hero-content { padding: 24px 20px; }
      .detail-hero-content h1 { font-size: 24px; }
      .detail-body { padding: 24px 16px 60px; }
      .detail-info-cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8px; }
      .detail-info-card { padding: 12px 8px; }
      .detail-info-card .dic-value { font-size: 12px; }
      .detail-dialect-box { padding: 18px 20px; }
      .detail-dialect-box .dialect-text { font-size: 17px; }
      .detail-map-wrap { height: 220px; }

      /* Category */
      .category-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }

      /* Accommodation Phase 2 */
      .accommodation-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; padding: 12px; }
      .acc-detail-gallery { height: 260px; }
      .acc-detail-name { font-size: 20px; }
      .acc-booking-bar .booking-price { font-size: 17px; }
      .acc-booking-bar .booking-btn { padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 14px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .theme-tiles { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
      .hero-slide-content h1 { font-size: 19px; }
      .category-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }

    body.onb-open { overflow: hidden; }
    .my-style-card-section {
      max-width: 1060px;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
      padding: 0 16px;
    }
    .my-style-card {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.1), rgba(129, 212, 250, 0.28));
      box-shadow: var(--onb-card-shadow);
    }
    .my-style-avatar {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 30px;
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--onb-gradient);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .my-style-meta {
      min-width: 0;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .my-style-kicker {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.7);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .my-style-title {
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1.25;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #09315d;
    }
    .my-style-desc {
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: rgba(9, 49, 93, 0.72);
    }
    .my-style-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .my-style-tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
      color: var(--onb-primary);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .my-style-reset {
      align-self: flex-start;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      color: #0a4c90;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.12);
    }
    .onb-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 4000;
      overflow-y: auto;
      background: rgba(7, 28, 53, 0.56);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      padding: 24px 16px 32px;
    }
    .onb-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      min-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      border-radius: 28px;
      background: #f8fbff;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 20, 60, 0.25);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .onb-progress-wrap {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 16px 18px 10px;
    }
    .onb-back,
    .onb-skip {
      min-width: 64px;
      padding: 8px 0;
      color: rgba(9, 49, 93, 0.75);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .onb-progress-text {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0a4c90;
    }
    .onb-progress-dots {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 0 18px 12px;
    }
    .onb-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--onb-step-dot);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
    }
    .onb-dot.active {
      transform: scale(1.2);
      background: var(--onb-step-dot-active);
    }
    .onb-step {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 8px 20px 24px;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .onb-step[hidden] { display: none; }
    .onb-intro {
      min-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
      padding: 0;
      gap: 0;
      background: var(--onb-gradient);
      color: var(--white);
    }
    .onb-intro-hero {
      padding: 36px 24px 28px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .onb-intro-mark {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .onb-intro-hero h2,
    .onb-step-title {
      font-size: var(--onb-title-size);
      line-height: 1.18;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      font-weight: var(--onb-font-weight-bold);
    }
    .onb-intro-hero p,
    .onb-step-subtitle {
      font-size: var(--onb-subtitle-size);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .onb-intro-hero p { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86); }
    .onb-step-subtitle { color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55); }
    .onb-hero-graphic {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 260px;
      margin: 30px auto 24px;
    }
    .onb-intro-panel {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding: 26px 24px 30px;
      border-radius: 28px 28px 0 0;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .onb-intro-copy {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.64);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .onb-intro-actions,
    .onb-result-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .onb-btn-primary,
    .onb-btn-secondary,
    .onb-next {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 54px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .onb-btn-primary,
    .onb-next {
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--onb-gradient);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.2);
    }
    .onb-btn-secondary {
      color: #0a4c90;
      background: rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.08);
    }
    .onb-choice-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .onb-style-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .onb-option-card,
    .onb-choice-btn,
    .onb-radio-option,
    .onb-chip {
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      background: var(--onb-card-bg);
      box-shadow: var(--onb-card-shadow);
      transition: transform 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease, background 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease;
    }
    .onb-option-card {
      min-height: 144px;
      padding: 18px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .onb-option-card[data-selected="true"],
    .onb-choice-btn[data-selected="true"],
    .onb-radio-option[data-selected="true"] {
      border-color: var(--onb-primary);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.14);
    }
    .onb-option-icon,
    .onb-choice-icon {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      background: rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.08);
      font-size: 22px;
    }
    .onb-option-name,
    .onb-choice-label {
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #102844;
    }
    .onb-option-desc {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: rgba(16, 40, 68, 0.68);
    }
    .onb-choice-btn {
      min-height: 110px;
      padding: 18px 14px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .onb-choice-icon {
      margin: 0 auto 10px;
    }
    .onb-radio-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .onb-radio-option {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .onb-radio-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #102844;
    }
    .onb-radio-meta {
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: rgba(16, 40, 68, 0.65);
    }
    .onb-chip-wrap {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .onb-chip {
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--onb-chip-bg);
      color: var(--onb-chip-text);
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      box-shadow: none;
    }
    .onb-chip[data-selected="true"] {
      color: var(--onb-chip-text-active);
      background: var(--onb-chip-bg-active);
      border-color: transparent;
    }
    .onb-selection-summary {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: rgba(16, 40, 68, 0.62);
    }
    .onb-input-wrap {
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: var(--onb-card-bg);
      box-shadow: var(--onb-card-shadow);
    }
    .onb-input-label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #102844;
    }
    .onb-input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.15);
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #102844;
      background: #fbfdff;
      outline: none;
    }
    .onb-input:focus {
      border-color: var(--onb-primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.12);
    }
    .onb-footer {
      padding: 0 20px 24px;
    }
    .onb-next[disabled] {
      cursor: default;
      opacity: 0.45;
      box-shadow: none;
    }
    .onb-result {
      padding-top: 0;
    }
    .onb-result-top {
      padding: 30px 20px 18px;
      margin: -8px -20px 0;
      background: var(--onb-gradient);
      color: var(--white);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .onb-result-top .onb-step-subtitle { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86); }
    .onb-result-card {
      margin-top: -6px;
      padding: 22px 18px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: var(--onb-card-bg);
      box-shadow: var(--onb-card-shadow);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .onb-result-avatar {
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
      margin: 0 auto 14px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.08);
      font-size: 38px;
    }
    .onb-result-name {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: rgba(16, 40, 68, 0.72);
    }
    .onb-result-title {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 1.25;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #102844;
    }
    .onb-result-info {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: rgba(16, 40, 68, 0.72);
    }
    .onb-result-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .onb-result-tag {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.08);
      color: var(--onb-primary);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .onb-overlay { padding-top: 36px; }
      .onb-container { min-height: 820px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .my-style-card-section { padding: 0 14px; }
      .my-style-card {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
      .my-style-reset {
        width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- === Fixed Header === -->
  <header class="main-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <div class="logo" id="logo-home">
        <div class="logo-title">🗺 어데가노</div>
        <div class="logo-sub">부산 여행의 모든 것</div>
      </div>
      <div class="search-bar">
        <input type="text" id="global-search" placeholder="부산에서 무엇을 찾으시나요? (예: 해운대, 돼지국밥)" />
        <button type="button" id="global-search-btn">🔍</button>
      </div>
      <div class="header-right">
        <a href="#">내 코스</a>
        <button class="btn-primary">로그인</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- === Nav Tabs === -->
  <nav class="nav-tabs">
    <div class="nav-inner hide-scroll">
      <div class="nav-tab active" data-tab="home">홈</div>
      <div class="nav-tab" data-tab="12">관광지</div>
      <div class="nav-tab" data-tab="39">맛집</div>
      <div class="nav-tab" data-tab="15">축제</div>
      <div class="nav-tab" data-tab="32">숙박</div>
      <div class="nav-tab" data-tab="14">문화시설</div>
      <div class="nav-tab" data-tab="planner">맞춤코스</div>
      <div class="nav-tab" data-tab="roulette">랜덤추천</div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- === Hero Carousel === -->
  <section class="hero" id="home-content">
    <div class="hero-carousel" id="hero-carousel">
      <div class="hero-slide active" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598587121287-c1d45edc53b3?q=90&w=2400&auto=format&fit=crop')">
        <div class="hero-slide-content">
          <h1>해운대의 아름다운 밤바다</h1>
          <p>부산 No.1 해변 핫플 · 야경부터 회까지 한 방에</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542456485-6d0e800d9e83?q=90&w=2400&auto=format&fit=crop')">
        <div class="hero-slide-content">
          <h1>뉴트로 감성 가득, 감천문화마을</h1>
          <p>부산의 마추픽추 · 골목마다 포토스팟</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555562725-3b95ee384aa3?q=90&w=2400&auto=format&fit=crop')">
        <div class="hero-slide-content">
          <h1>부산의 심장, 광안대교</h1>
          <p>야경이 정말 아름다워요 · 광안리 해변에서 한 잔</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506460144933-c8d3da13e3b7?q=90&w=2400&auto=format&fit=crop')">
        <div class="hero-slide-content">
          <h1>산복도로에서 내려다본 부산</h1>
          <p>바다와 도시의 만남 · 인생샷 보장</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542845618-ff3db139b4b0?q=90&w=2400&auto=format&fit=crop')">
        <div class="hero-slide-content">
          <h1>바다 위의 기차, 해리단길</h1>
          <p>감성 여행의 시작 · 뉴트로 카페 투어</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-dots" id="hero-dots"></div>
      <div class="hero-counter" id="hero-counter">1 / 5</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="my-style-card-section" id="my-style-card" hidden>
    <div class="my-style-card">
      <div class="my-style-avatar" id="my-style-avatar">🌊</div>
      <div class="my-style-meta">
        <div class="my-style-kicker">나의 부산 여행 스타일</div>
        <div class="my-style-title" id="my-style-title">부산 여행자</div>
        <div class="my-style-desc" id="my-style-desc">당신에게 어울리는 부산 코스를 골라드릴게요.</div>
        <div class="my-style-tags" id="my-style-tags"></div>
      </div>
      <button class="my-style-reset" id="my-style-reset" type="button">재설정</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- === Mood Chips === -->
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mood-chips hide-scroll" id="mood-chips">
      <button class="mood-chip active" data-mood="all">🏝 전체</button>
      <button class="mood-chip" data-mood="바다">🌊 바다힐링</button>
      <button class="mood-chip" data-mood="야경">🌃 야경투어</button>
      <button class="mood-chip" data-mood="뉴트로">🎨 뉴트로감성</button>
      <button class="mood-chip" data-mood="맛집">🍜 미식여행</button>
      <button class="mood-chip" data-mood="감성">📸 사진맛집</button>
      <button class="mood-chip" data-mood="가족">👨‍👩‍👧 가족나들이</button>
      <button class="mood-chip" data-mood="커플">💑 커플데이트</button>
      <button class="mood-chip" data-mood="혼자">🚶 혼행</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- === Main Content === -->
  <main class="container">

    <!-- Quick Start -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="quick-start">
        <div class="quick-start-head">
          <div>
            <div class="quick-start-kicker">START HERE</div>
            <div class="quick-start-title">부산 여행, 이렇게 시작해보이소</div>
            <div class="quick-start-desc">어디부터 눌러야 할지 고민되지 않도록 첫 화면의 시작점을 세 갈래로 정리했습니다. 바로 검색하거나, 조건을 말해 맞춤 코스를 받고, 고민되면 랜덤 추천으로 출발하면 됩니다.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-start-chip">부산 관광 데이터 기반 추천</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quick-start-grid">
          <div class="quick-start-card">
            <div>
              <div class="quick-start-icon">🔎</div>
              <h3>바로 찾기</h3>
              <p>해운대, 광안리, 돼지국밥처럼 떠오른 키워드가 있다면 바로 검색해서 장소 상세로 들어갈 수 있습니다.</p>
            </div>
            <button class="quick-start-btn secondary" id="quick-search-btn" type="button">검색창으로 이동</button>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-start-card featured">
            <div>
              <div class="quick-start-icon">🧭</div>
              <h3>맞춤 코스 받기</h3>
              <p>일정, 동행, 분위기를 말하면 조건에 맞는 부산 코스를 조합해서 지도와 함께 보여드립니다.</p>
            </div>
            <button class="quick-start-btn" id="quick-course-btn" type="button">맞춤 코스 시작</button>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-start-card">
            <div>
              <div class="quick-start-icon">🎲</div>
              <h3>랜덤 추천</h3>
              <p>결정이 어려울 때는 관광지, 맛집, 문화시설을 섞어서 오늘의 부산 코스를 바로 뽑아드립니다.</p>
            </div>
            <button class="roulette-btn" id="roulette-btn" type="button">
              <span class="icon">🎲</span>
              <span>랜덤 코스 뽑기</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Theme Tiles -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>테마별 부산 여행</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-copy">가장 많이 찾는 여행 무드만 남겼습니다. 원하는 분위기를 누르면 부산 관광 데이터를 그 테마에 맞춰 다시 보여줍니다.</p>
      <div class="theme-tiles" id="theme-tiles">
        <div class="theme-tile" data-theme="바다힐링" data-theme-query="바다 힐링 코스" data-icon="🌊">
          <div class="theme-tile-icon"></div>
          <div class="theme-tile-label">바다힐링</div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-tile" data-theme="뉴트로감성" data-theme-query="뉴트로 감성 카페 투어" data-icon="🎨">
          <div class="theme-tile-icon"></div>
          <div class="theme-tile-label">뉴트로감성</div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-tile" data-theme="야경투어" data-theme-query="야경 투어 코스" data-icon="🌃">
          <div class="theme-tile-icon"></div>
          <div class="theme-tile-label">야경투어</div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-tile" data-theme="미식여행" data-theme-query="미식 여행 맛집 코스" data-icon="🍜">
          <div class="theme-tile-icon"></div>
          <div class="theme-tile-label">미식여행</div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-tile" data-theme="산책길" data-theme-query="걷기 좋은 산책길 코스" data-icon="🚶">
          <div class="theme-tile-icon"></div>
          <div class="theme-tile-label">산책길</div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-tile" data-theme="사진맛집" data-theme-query="사진 감성 포토스팟" data-icon="📸">
          <div class="theme-tile-icon"></div>
          <div class="theme-tile-label">사진맛집</div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-tile" data-theme="가족나들이" data-theme-query="가족과 함께하는 부산 나들이" data-icon="👨‍👩‍👧">
          <div class="theme-tile-icon"></div>
          <div class="theme-tile-label">가족나들이</div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-tile" data-theme="커플데이트" data-theme-query="여친이랑 커플 데이트 코스" data-icon="💑">
          <div class="theme-tile-icon"></div>
          <div class="theme-tile-label">커플데이트</div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-tile" data-theme="혼행" data-theme-query="혼자 뚜벅이 여행" data-icon="🧳">
          <div class="theme-tile-icon"></div>
          <div class="theme-tile-label">혼행</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hot Ranking Section -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="ranking-title">🔥 지금 가장 핫한 부산</h2>
        <button class="see-more-btn" id="ranking-more" type="button">더보기 →</button>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-wrap">
        <div class="carousel-arrow prev">❮</div>
        <div class="card-carousel hide-scroll" id="ranking-carousel"></div>
        <div class="carousel-arrow next">❯</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Live Dashboard Band -->
    <section class="content-section" style="padding-top: 0;">
      <div class="live-band" id="live-band">
        <div class="lb-title">📊 지금 부산</div>
        <div class="live-tile">
          <span class="icon">📅</span>
          <div class="body">
            <div class="label">오늘</div>
            <div class="value" id="tile-date">--/--</div>
            <div class="sub" id="tile-date-sub">--요일</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="live-tile">
          <span class="icon">🌤</span>
          <div class="body">
            <div class="label">날씨</div>
            <div class="value" id="tile-weather">--°C</div>
            <div class="sub" id="tile-weather-sub">불러오는 중</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="live-tile">
          <span class="icon">🌅</span>
          <div class="body">
            <div class="label">일몰</div>
            <div class="value" id="tile-sunset">--:--</div>
            <div class="sub">해운대 기준</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="live-tile">
          <span class="icon">🎪</span>
          <div class="body">
            <div class="label">진행중 축제</div>
            <div class="value" id="tile-festival">불러오는 중</div>
            <div class="sub" id="tile-festival-sub"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Theme Section: 바다 -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>🌊 바다가 부른다</h2>
        <button class="see-more-btn" type="button" data-see-more="beach">더보기 →</button>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-wrap">
        <div class="carousel-arrow prev">❮</div>
        <div class="card-carousel hide-scroll" id="beach-carousel"></div>
        <div class="carousel-arrow next">❯</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Theme Section: 미식 -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>🍜 부산 미식 로드</h2>
        <button class="see-more-btn" type="button" data-see-more="food">더보기 →</button>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-wrap">
        <div class="carousel-arrow prev">❮</div>
        <div class="card-carousel hide-scroll" id="food-carousel"></div>
        <div class="carousel-arrow next">❯</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Theme Section: 숙소 -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>🏨 부산 숙소</h2>
        <button class="see-more-btn" type="button" data-see-more="accommodation">더보기 →</button>
      </div>
      <p class="section-copy">홈 숙소 카드는 한국관광공사 숙박 데이터를 기준으로 불러옵니다. 자세한 후보는 더보기에서 계속 탐색할 수 있습니다.</p>
      <div class="carousel-wrap">
        <div class="carousel-arrow prev">❮</div>
        <div class="card-carousel hide-scroll" id="accommodation-carousel"></div>
        <div class="carousel-arrow next">❯</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Theme Section: 축제 -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>🎪 지금 열리는 축제</h2>
        <button class="see-more-btn" type="button" data-see-more="festival">더보기 →</button>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-wrap">
        <div class="carousel-arrow prev">❮</div>
        <div class="card-carousel hide-scroll" id="festival-carousel"></div>
        <div class="carousel-arrow next">❯</div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <!-- === Footer === -->
  <footer class="main-footer">
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-title">🗺 어데가노</div>
      <div class="footer-desc">2026 관광데이터 활용 공모전 출품작 · 부산 여행 추천 웹앱</div>
      <div class="footer-credit">Made by 민석 &amp; Claude · Powered by 한국관광공사 TourAPI</div>
      <div class="footer-social">
        <span>📘</span>
        <span>📷</span>
        <span>🐦</span>
        <span>💬</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- === Chatbot FAB === -->
  <button class="chatbot-fab" id="chatbot-fab" type="button" title="맞춤 코스 플래너">
    🤖
    <span class="chatbot-fab-badge">코스</span>
  </button>

  <!-- === Chatbot Panel === -->
  <aside class="chatbot-panel" id="chatbot-panel">
    <div class="chatbot-header">
      <div class="chatbot-header-title">
        부산 코스 플래너
        <small>어떤 여행 하고 싶은지 말해보이소</small>
      </div>
      <button class="chatbot-close" id="chatbot-close" type="button">×</button>
    </div>
    <div class="chatbot-messages" id="chatbot-messages"></div>
    <div class="chatbot-suggestions" id="chatbot-suggestions">
      <div class="suggestion">당일치기 해변 코스</div>
      <div class="suggestion">여친이랑 1박2일 뚜벅이</div>
      <div class="suggestion">가족 나들이 코스</div>
      <div class="suggestion">야경 맛집 투어</div>
    </div>
    <div class="chatbot-input-area">
      <input type="text" class="chatbot-input" id="chatbot-input" placeholder="어떤 여행 하고 싶으신가예?" />
      <button class="chatbot-send" id="chatbot-send" type="button">전송</button>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- === Course Modal === -->
  <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modal-backdrop">
    <div class="modal">
      <div class="modal-head">
