              <path d="M42 122C55 109 69 109 82 122C95 135 109 135 122 122C135 109 149 109 162 122C175 135 189 135 202 122" stroke="white" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M42 142C55 129 69 129 82 142C95 155 109 155 122 142C135 129 149 129 162 142C175 155 189 155 202 142" stroke="white" stroke-opacity="0.74" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M120 46C98.46 46 81 63.46 81 85C81 112.3 120 142 120 142C120 142 159 112.3 159 85C159 63.46 141.54 46 120 46Z" fill="white"/>
              <circle cx="120" cy="84" r="14" fill="#42A5F5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="onb-intro-panel">
          <div class="onb-intro-copy">5가지 질문으로 나만의 부산 여행 취향을 정리하고, 바로 홈 추천에 반영해드릴게요.</div>
          <div class="onb-intro-actions">
            <button class="onb-btn-primary" id="onb-start" type="button">시작하기</button>
            <button class="onb-btn-secondary" id="onb-later" type="button">나중에 하기</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="onb-step" data-step="style" role="group" aria-labelledby="onb-title-style" hidden>
        <h2 class="onb-step-title" id="onb-title-style">어떤 여행을 원하시나요?</h2>
        <p class="onb-step-subtitle">지금 가장 끌리는 분위기를 하나 골라주세요.</p>
        <div class="onb-style-grid" id="onb-style-options">
          <button class="onb-option-card" type="button" data-onb-single="travelStyle" data-value="healing" aria-pressed="false">
            <span class="onb-option-icon">🌊</span>
            <span class="onb-option-name">힐링</span>
            <span class="onb-option-desc">여유롭게 걷고 쉬는 여행</span>
          </button>
          <button class="onb-option-card" type="button" data-onb-single="travelStyle" data-value="active" aria-pressed="false">
            <span class="onb-option-icon">🏄</span>
