            <span class="onb-option-desc">부산다운 맛을 중심으로</span>
          </button>
          <button class="onb-option-card" type="button" data-onb-single="travelStyle" data-value="culture" aria-pressed="false">
            <span class="onb-option-icon">🏛</span>
            <span class="onb-option-name">문화</span>
            <span class="onb-option-desc">골목과 전시, 이야기 중심</span>
          </button>
          <button class="onb-option-card" type="button" data-onb-single="travelStyle" data-value="photo" aria-pressed="false">
            <span class="onb-option-icon">📸</span>
            <span class="onb-option-name">사진</span>
            <span class="onb-option-desc">기억에 남는 장면을 찾는 여행</span>
          </button>
