      <section class="onb-step" data-step="duration" role="group" aria-labelledby="onb-title-duration" hidden>
        <h2 class="onb-step-title" id="onb-title-duration">여행 기간은 어느 정도인가요?</h2>
        <p class="onb-step-subtitle">일정에 맞는 밀도로 추천을 준비할게요.</p>
        <div class="onb-radio-list" id="onb-duration-options">
          <button class="onb-radio-option" type="button" data-onb-single="duration" data-value="dayTrip" aria-pressed="false">
