      <section class="onb-step" data-step="nickname" role="group" aria-labelledby="onb-title-nickname" hidden>
        <h2 class="onb-step-title" id="onb-title-nickname">어떻게 불러드리면 좋을까요?</h2>
        <p class="onb-step-subtitle">닉네임은 선택 입력이에요. 비워두셔도 괜찮아요.</p>
